{"pin":"BH00044","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00044","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be to the Lord of the Worlds, Who hath summoned all peoples, as one, through His Most Great Name, in such wise that [3.5s]... ...As to the question thou has asked concerning the minimum amount of property on which Huquq is payable, this was mentioned in His exalted and glorious presence and the following is what the Tongue of Grandeur uttered… Blessed is he who in the prime of his youth and the heyday of his life","first_line_orig":"حمد مولی العالم را سزاست که جمیع امم را وحده باسم اعظم دعوت نمود بشانی که  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"6470","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15704.366x","source":"BLIB_Or15704","locator":"366x"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15733.076","source":"BLIB_Or15733","locator":"076"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA18:511","source":"INBA18","locator":"511","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v018/?page=257"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA22:001","source":"INBA22","locator":"001","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v022/?page=1"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA81:171x","source":"INBA81","locator":"171x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v081/?page=174"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ANDA#27 p.03x","source":"ANDA","locator":"27 p.03x","url":"https://www.afnanlibrary.org/d/andalib-issue-27"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK4.227.14x","source":"AVK4","locator":"227.14x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK4/ak4-231.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#080","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"080","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/774158970"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MSHR5.440x","source":"MSHR5","locator":"440x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/1731.pdf#page=436"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_ATBH#71x","source":"BRL_ATBH","locator":"71x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/701490307"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BR